FIGS. 2A-C illustrate exemplary scenarios of a distance measure verification process;
FIGS. 3A-B illustrate exemplary embodiments of a user interface;
FIG. 4 illustrates an exemplary embodiment of a requesting entity;
FIG. 5 illustrates a block diagram of exemplary embodiment of a machine learning module;
FIG. 6 illustrates a diagram of an exemplary nodal network;
FIG. 7 illustrates a block diagram of an exemplary node;
